{"nodes": [{"id": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_002_verdict_derivation_formatting_story", "label": "STORY-002: admin_formatting.py \u2014 verdict derivation, relative time, device and shares", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".agents/stories/PRD-006-admin-console/STORY-002-verdict-derivation-formatting.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_002_verdict_derivation_formatting_derived_once_row_model", "label": "Derived-once row model", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/stories/PRD-006-admin-console/STORY-002-verdict-derivation-formatting.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every displayed value on a register row is computed once in Python when the row is built (in admin_formatting.to_audit_row), never at render time, because Reflex component functions receive Vars, not values \u2014 the same reason PRD-004 put format_duplicate_info in formatting.py."}, {"id": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_002_verdict_derivation_formatting_verdict_precedence", "label": "Verdict derivation precedence", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/stories/PRD-006-admin-console/STORY-002-verdict-derivation-formatting.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "derive_verdict follows a fixed precedence so two rows with identical fields never render differently: was_duplicate_blocked -> held; suspicious_pattern is not None -> denied; success = 0 -> fault; otherwise cleared."}, {"id": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_002_verdict_derivation_formatting_risk3_no_model_used_branch", "label": "Risk 3: verdict never branches on model_used", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/stories/PRD-006-admin-console/STORY-002-verdict-derivation-formatting.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The obvious way to separate an upstream failure from an internal one is to check whether a model was recorded \u2014 and it is wrong, because the output-side PiiRedactorError arm logs a model_used value even on a failed row. derive_verdict never branches on model_used, and this reasoning is recorded in a module comment so the 'improvement' is not reintroduced."}], "edges": [{"source": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_002_verdict_derivation_formatting_story", "target": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_001_audit_row_model_story", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/stories/PRD-006-admin-console/STORY-002-verdict-derivation-formatting.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_002_verdict_derivation_formatting_story", "target": "chat_ui_chat_ui_admin_formatting_derive_verdict", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/stories/PRD-006-admin-console/STORY-002-verdict-derivation-formatting.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_002_verdict_derivation_formatting_story", "target": "chat_ui_chat_ui_admin_formatting_to_audit_row", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/stories/PRD-006-admin-console/STORY-002-verdict-derivation-formatting.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_002_verdict_derivation_formatting_story", "target": "chat_ui_chat_ui_admin_formatting_format_share", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/stories/PRD-006-admin-console/STORY-002-verdict-derivation-formatting.md", "sour